Description: pan/bi, panvk: keep the fractional textureQueryLod for trilinear samplers
 Bifrost rounded the LOD returned by textureQueryLod to the nearest level.
 Read the sampler's mipmap mode from the bound descriptor and keep the
 fractional clamped LOD for linear mipmap filtering.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
